VALUES ('authority-6c057df915be3014e3ac79bb', 'Cornell University College of Veterinary Medicine — Canine Health Center', 'https://www.vet.cornell.edu/departments-centers-and-institutes/riney-canine-health-center/canine-health-topics/pet-food-and-toy-recalls', 'veterinary_university', 96, 'en', 'Pet food and toy recalls', 'dog', '["食事"]', 'Pet food and toy recalls
November 9, 2023 - FDA and CDC investigate cases of Salmonella linked to pet food; Multiple brands recalled.
On November 9th the FDA and CDC put out a press release announcing the recall of multiple brands of pet food made by Mid America Pet Food. Mid America Pet Food has voluntarily recalled all pet food brands it manufactured with a best by date before 10/31/2024. This recall expands previous recalls issued in September and October of 2023.
See a full list of dog foods included in the recall .', '2026-08-11T05:44:37.245Z', 1, '2026-08-11T05:44:37.245Z', '2026-08-11T05:44:37.245Z')
