VALUES ('authority-3861ec4de000556391aa8d6b', 'Cornell University College of Veterinary Medicine — Feline Health Center', 'https://www.vet.cornell.edu/departments-centers-and-institutes/cornell-feline-health-center/health-information/catwatch', 'veterinary_university', 96, 'en', 'CatWatch', 'cat', '["行動・しつけ","生活環境","予防・通院"]', 'CatWatch
This printed monthly newsletter, provided free of charge to Feline Health Center members , provides cat lovers with up-to-date information on a variety of feline health issues.
With contributions from experts across a broad spectrum of disciplines ranging from dermatology to internal medicine and behavior, Cat Watch is a fun and informative way to keep up-to-date on current issues affecting feline welfare.
Become a member and start receiving your free subscription to Cat Watch.
Cat Watch is a monthly printed newsletter publication that is created in conjunction with Belvoir Media Group.', '2026-08-11T05:44:37.245Z', 1, '2026-08-11T05:44:37.245Z', '2026-08-11T05:44:37.245Z')
