VALUES ('authority-e86959a39416f4d487aacde0', 'MSD/Merck Veterinary Manual — Cat Owners', 'https://www.merckvetmanual.com/cat-owners/digestive-disorders-of-cats/disorders-of-the-liver-and-gallbladder-in-cats', 'peer_reviewed_veterinary_manual', 92, 'en', 'Disorders of the Liver and Gallbladder in Cats', 'cat', '["食事","排泄","皮膚・被毛","目・涙","耳","口・歯","呼吸","行動・しつけ","予防・通院","中毒","消化器","泌尿器","神経","腫瘍"]', 'PET OWNER VERSION
Disorders of the Liver and Gallbladder in Cats
Full Review: Aug 2018 By Sharon A. Center , DVM, DACVIM , Department of Clinical Sciences, College of Veterinary Medicine, Cornell
University Last updated: Sept 2024
v3244278
