VALUES ('authority-7833d92200ff16a5ddf3fb5f', 'MSD/Merck Veterinary Manual — Cat Owners', 'https://www.merckvetmanual.com/cat-owners/reproductive-disorders-of-cats/reproductive-disorders-of-female-cats', 'peer_reviewed_veterinary_manual', 92, 'en', 'Reproductive Disorders of Female Cats', 'cat', '["食事","排泄","耳","行動・しつけ","生活環境","予防・通院","消化器","腫瘍"]', 'PET OWNER VERSION
Reproductive Disorders of Female Cats
Full Review: Aug 2018 By Mushtaq A. Memon , BVSc, PhD, DACT , Department of Veterinary Clinical Sciences, Washington State University Last updated: Sept 2024
v3246198
Abnormal or Difficult Birth (Dystocia) |
False Pregnancy (Pseudopregnancy) |
Follicular Cysts |
Overgrowth of Mammary Tissue (Mammary Hypertrophy) |
Mastitis |
Metritis |
