Congenital and Inherited Disorders of the Digestive System of Dogs
Full Review: May 2018 By Stanley I. Rubin , DVM, MS, DACVIM , Department of Veterinary Clinical Medicine, College of Veterinary Medicine,
University of Illinois at Urbana-Champaign Last updated: Jun 2026
