Disorders of the Mouth in Dogs
Full Review: May 2018 By Alexander M. Reiter , Dipl. Tzt., DEVDC, DAVDC , Department of Clinical Sciences & Advanced Medicine, School of Veterinary
Medicine, University of Pennsylvania Last updated: Jun 2026
